WEBVTT

00:05.990 --> 00:06.740
Captain!

00:07.140 --> 00:08.670
It's an army of monsters!

00:08.670 --> 00:09.940
The stampede's coming!

00:11.110 --> 00:14.020
Aid from the castle didn't 
make it in time...

00:14.650 --> 00:16.410
All units!

00:16.410 --> 00:20.020
We will join with the adventurers' guild 
and defend our defensive line with our lives!

00:22.790 --> 00:25.580
May the blessing of the spirits 
be with the Kingdom of Palettia!

00:25.580 --> 00:28.810
May the blessing of the spirits 
be with the Kingdom of Palettia!

01:53.590 --> 02:01.970
The Magical Revolution

01:53.590 --> 02:01.970
The Magical Revolution

01:53.590 --> 02:01.970
of the Reincarnated Princess and the Genius Young Lady

02:04.190 --> 02:06.480
There they are. Can we get there in time?

02:06.480 --> 02:07.650
I'm worried.

02:07.650 --> 02:11.100
Yeah. I want to get those materials 
while they're in good shape.

02:11.100 --> 02:12.290
We gotta hurry!

02:12.290 --> 02:15.560
I'm impressed you seem so 
calm about this, Miss Anis.

02:15.800 --> 02:19.740
Yeah, well, this robe is 
made of special materials.

02:19.740 --> 02:22.430
Oh, if you're cold, you can stick closer.

02:22.430 --> 02:24.400
No, that's not...

02:29.220 --> 02:30.420
Miss Anis...

02:32.670 --> 02:35.860
Before we leave, there's 
something I want to know.

02:36.700 --> 02:39.040
Why do you want the dragon's magicite?

02:39.550 --> 02:40.760
Oh...

02:41.380 --> 02:43.650
So I can be a magician.

02:46.680 --> 02:49.700
What does that have to do with magicite?

02:49.700 --> 02:52.150
I haven't told many people about it...

02:52.430 --> 02:57.100
But using magicite allows you to use a 
power that's basically pseudo-magic.

02:57.410 --> 03:00.310
Using it... how?

03:00.570 --> 03:05.470
Oh, well... You need a biological 
medium to serve as a catalyst.

03:05.470 --> 03:07.290
A biological medium?

03:07.290 --> 03:07.950
Yeah.

03:08.390 --> 03:12.250
Which is why I had the idea 
to implant the magicite in my body.

03:13.240 --> 03:15.410
I've done lots of clinical tests already.

03:15.410 --> 03:16.950
There are no safety issues...

03:17.270 --> 03:18.340
I think.

03:19.420 --> 03:21.810
Your magicology is wonderful.

03:21.810 --> 03:24.590
And your magic tools are 
designed to help people.

03:24.590 --> 03:29.690
But any arts performed using 
magicite seem frightening to me.

03:29.690 --> 03:31.120
That's fair.

03:31.120 --> 03:35.550
It might just be a way to 
turn myself into a monster.

03:36.690 --> 03:40.560
But since I can't use magic the regular way,

03:40.560 --> 03:42.190
it's my only option.

03:42.800 --> 03:45.610
Because that's all I want.

03:55.450 --> 03:58.150
It's started! Let's hurry, Euphie!

03:58.920 --> 03:59.890
Right!

04:18.580 --> 04:20.020
Leader?!

04:20.020 --> 04:22.670
Leave this one to me! Get going!

04:23.290 --> 04:26.380
Help from the capital is never 
gonna make it in time.

04:26.380 --> 04:28.420
You gotta survive, even if I don't.

04:32.960 --> 04:35.720
Leader!

04:36.800 --> 04:39.830
Move it! Move it! Move it!

04:46.260 --> 04:48.340
This must be a joke, right?

04:48.670 --> 04:52.050
Hah! I guess only you could get here 
from the capital in time!

04:52.400 --> 04:54.530
The plundering princess of the hunt...

04:54.530 --> 04:57.020
The Marauder Princess!

04:59.190 --> 05:02.890
Princess Anisphia?! And Lady Magenta?!

05:02.890 --> 05:05.870
Hey, Captain. Been a while.

05:05.870 --> 05:07.600
So where do we stand?

05:08.620 --> 05:11.140
We've managed to hold the 
stampede back thus far.

05:11.140 --> 05:12.320
But the problem is...

05:12.650 --> 05:15.380
The dragon behind it, right?

05:18.050 --> 05:19.330
Okay!

05:19.600 --> 05:23.030
Then you can leave the dragon to me.

05:23.030 --> 05:26.770
I'm basically the only flying 
fighter this kingdom has.

05:26.770 --> 05:27.760
Are you serious?!

05:27.980 --> 05:30.080
Rather... Are you <i>sane</i>?!

05:30.080 --> 05:32.370
I am serious, and I'm quite sane.

05:32.740 --> 05:35.520
So while I'm taking care of the dragon,

05:35.520 --> 05:39.190
I want all of you and Euphie 
to hold the stampede back.

05:41.200 --> 05:41.890
Very well.

05:42.250 --> 05:43.830
Okay, make it happen!

05:47.020 --> 05:48.320
Miss Anis!

05:49.390 --> 05:52.420
You intend to take on the dragon alone?

05:52.420 --> 05:54.860
Well, it'll be an aerial battle.

05:54.860 --> 05:57.320
I doubt you have any experience with those,

05:57.320 --> 06:00.720
and the stampede's too dangerous 
for the knights to stop on their own.

06:02.280 --> 06:04.240
This is just the most effective way.

06:04.240 --> 06:06.050
You understand, don't you, Euphie?

06:07.380 --> 06:11.610
There are some things I can't agree with, 
even if I do understand.

06:13.250 --> 06:15.590
Maybe so, but...

06:17.540 --> 06:18.830
I'll be fine.

06:22.830 --> 06:24.080
All right.

06:25.010 --> 06:26.360
Okay, then...

06:28.540 --> 06:29.780
What is that?

06:29.780 --> 06:31.690
A product of my research.

06:31.690 --> 06:34.290
They're pills made with crushed magicite.

06:34.290 --> 06:36.380
I call it "magic medicine."

06:36.380 --> 06:37.470
Magic—

06:37.470 --> 06:40.320
It basically works like 
stamina-boosting magic.

06:40.320 --> 06:42.070
It's not what you're thinking.

06:42.360 --> 06:45.910
It does have a few little side effects, 
but don't worry.

06:46.300 --> 06:48.190
Those <i>are</i> safe to use, right?!

06:48.190 --> 06:50.040
It's fine! They're legal!

06:50.040 --> 06:53.930
They kinda make you feel hyper 
and lose your sense of reason, but...

06:53.930 --> 06:56.090
And how is that "fine"?!

07:19.400 --> 07:20.930
Miss Anis?

07:20.930 --> 07:22.200
I'm fine, really!

07:23.070 --> 07:28.010
Okay, I'm gonna take out some of the 
small fry while I wait for the dragon.

07:32.210 --> 07:33.860
Now...

07:35.550 --> 07:40.740
It's time for a super-fun materials hunt!

08:13.910 --> 08:15.140
Die.

08:24.870 --> 08:25.970
Miss Anis!

08:27.690 --> 08:30.160
Grant me now a cage of scorching heat.

08:30.660 --> 08:32.310
<i>Incantation magic...</i>

08:34.690 --> 08:37.150
Envelop everything I see before my eyes,

08:37.490 --> 08:39.650
and reduce it all to embers!

08:42.280 --> 08:43.920
Explosion!

08:55.630 --> 09:00.080
<i>Euphie's magic is so amazing.</i>

09:04.120 --> 09:06.760
<i>So this... is real magic.</i>

09:32.470 --> 09:35.010
That's... the dragon?

09:35.900 --> 09:37.280
It's so...

09:37.280 --> 09:38.900
beautiful!

09:39.130 --> 09:41.600
Amazing! Absolutely amazing!

09:41.980 --> 09:44.140
To think such creatures exist...

09:44.140 --> 09:46.530
The world never ceases to amaze!

09:47.370 --> 09:48.680
Hey, Euphie...

09:49.510 --> 09:52.180
If I had that dragon's magicite,

09:52.680 --> 09:55.930
what do you think I'd be able to do?

10:03.020 --> 10:03.870
Uh...

10:03.870 --> 10:06.330
Okay, I'll be back soon!

10:11.940 --> 10:13.700
Miss Anis...

10:26.300 --> 10:27.770
Nice to meet you.

10:29.220 --> 10:32.550
And now... take this!

10:36.360 --> 10:37.540
Is that...

10:39.900 --> 10:41.700
<i>My blade won't cut it!</i>

10:42.180 --> 10:43.470
<i>What is that thing?!</i>

10:43.990 --> 10:47.610
<i>The Mana Blade—a sword whose 
blade is generated by mana—</i>

10:47.610 --> 10:51.320
<i>is my prized invention that cuts through 
both physical and magical bodies!</i>

11:01.930 --> 11:03.390
Okay, fine!

11:08.790 --> 11:10.400
<i>What the hell?!</i>

11:21.360 --> 11:22.540
Miss Anis!

11:50.080 --> 11:51.140
<i>Euphie...</i>

12:00.040 --> 12:02.690
<i>Faster... Move faster!</i>

12:03.290 --> 12:04.940
<i>I have to get to her!</i>

12:05.340 --> 12:08.110
<i>Like she did for me!</i>

12:34.850 --> 12:36.440
Miss Anis!

12:36.440 --> 12:38.160
Miss Anis! Are you all right?!

12:42.000 --> 12:42.870
Euphie?

12:52.270 --> 12:53.430
I still have...

13:00.200 --> 13:01.500
Euphie?

13:01.900 --> 13:04.960
You mean to continue fighting?

13:05.620 --> 13:09.190
You almost died just now!

13:09.190 --> 13:12.690
Why would you... go to such lengths for...

13:16.920 --> 13:18.950
It's a simple reason.

13:19.780 --> 13:23.520
Because that's what I feel 
a magician should be.

13:25.730 --> 13:30.480
That thing takes people's smiles away. 
It can't be allowed to exist.

13:30.480 --> 13:32.220
That's why I fight it.

13:32.220 --> 13:37.960
The ideal magician in my mind 
always uses magic to make people smile.

13:38.440 --> 13:42.420
If I run away now, I can't call 
myself a magician anymore.

13:45.850 --> 13:47.770
I don't understand.

13:48.480 --> 13:54.700
But if the way you feel is what 
allows me to stay here...

13:54.700 --> 13:57.220
I want to protect it.

13:58.290 --> 13:59.890
That's why I don't want to let you go!

13:59.890 --> 14:01.890
I don't want you to die!

14:02.270 --> 14:05.750
If not going now means you 
won't be yourself anymore,

14:05.750 --> 14:08.380
then please, at least take me with you!

14:08.730 --> 14:10.740
I won't get in your way!

14:10.740 --> 14:13.320
I want to understand your magic!

14:13.320 --> 14:15.710
If you're worried about the flying, 
I've got the hang of it now!

14:15.710 --> 14:18.110
I can assist you! I can defend!

14:18.110 --> 14:20.210
I can be your support!

14:21.450 --> 14:25.160
So... So please...

14:26.400 --> 14:29.840
Don't go alone!

14:39.040 --> 14:41.130
Okay. I won't.

14:42.350 --> 14:45.340
But I do have to stop that thing.

14:46.290 --> 14:48.530
So I have to go.

14:50.100 --> 14:52.360
But you're right. It'll be tough alone.

14:54.280 --> 14:56.320
So I'll ask you myself, Euphie.

14:59.290 --> 15:00.760
Will you come with me?

15:06.830 --> 15:11.550
If that's what you want, 
I will accompany you anywhere.

15:15.120 --> 15:16.260
Okay!

15:17.750 --> 15:20.000
Let's go dragon-hunting!

15:24.740 --> 15:29.760
Miss Anis, I believe the dragon has 
covered itself with a magic barrier.

15:29.760 --> 15:31.160
A magic barrier...

15:31.490 --> 15:32.570
So that's why!

15:33.170 --> 15:36.780
Thanks, Euphie. Do you know 
a way we can get around it?

15:37.160 --> 15:40.360
Would it be too difficult 
to get around behind it?

15:40.660 --> 15:43.490
For a body that large to sustain flight,

15:43.490 --> 15:45.820
it must have its own unique magic.

15:46.120 --> 15:48.590
And what's making that possible should be...

15:48.590 --> 15:49.810
Its wings?

15:54.790 --> 15:59.620
Euphie, the only way to get behind that thing
 is to shoot straight for it at top speed.

15:59.620 --> 16:00.520
Can you do that?

16:00.520 --> 16:01.170
I can!

16:01.900 --> 16:03.640
I'm putting my life in your hands!

16:03.980 --> 16:05.610
I accepted that long ago.

16:09.890 --> 16:11.310
<i>Our target is its wings.</i>

16:18.200 --> 16:19.630
Wind Cutter!

16:23.050 --> 16:24.010
Now!

16:25.410 --> 16:26.910
Wind Blast!

16:44.890 --> 16:46.280
This time...

16:47.520 --> 16:50.140
You're the one who's gonna fall!

16:56.630 --> 17:01.080
Cut! Cut! Cut! Cut! Cut! Cut! Cut!

17:01.080 --> 17:04.150
Cut it down!

17:11.250 --> 17:12.420
Got it!

17:12.420 --> 17:13.540
Miss Anis!

17:14.350 --> 17:16.580
Nice catch, Euphie!

17:48.090 --> 17:49.790
Miss Anis, we should retreat!

17:49.790 --> 17:51.790
Yeah, that's defini—

17:53.740 --> 17:54.780
We can't.

17:56.170 --> 18:01.330
If we dodge it, that entire area 
will be mowed down.

18:09.640 --> 18:11.940
Miss Anis, what are you...

18:12.280 --> 18:14.150
I'm going to cut that thing.

18:14.980 --> 18:17.610
You can't do that! It's impossible!

18:17.610 --> 18:19.030
That thing is magic, too.

18:19.540 --> 18:21.580
And if it's a pure mana shot,

18:22.070 --> 18:24.300
my blade should be able to cut it.

18:27.780 --> 18:29.170
Mana Blade...

18:29.720 --> 18:31.670
Release limiter!

18:43.440 --> 18:44.690
Miss Anis!

18:44.690 --> 18:48.760
If I can't show you that the 
impossible can be made possible,

18:48.760 --> 18:50.650
I can't call myself a magician!

18:55.490 --> 18:56.560
All right.

18:59.410 --> 19:02.990
Show me, then. I'll protect you.

19:04.410 --> 19:06.710
I'll be watching!

19:18.980 --> 19:22.310
<i>Just how dense is this mass of mana?</i>

19:22.310 --> 19:25.140
<i>But still, I have to do this!</i>

19:25.140 --> 19:27.260
<i>This is no ordinary sword.</i>

19:27.260 --> 19:29.250
<i>It's my own magic!</i>

19:29.250 --> 19:32.600
<i>It's the infinite potential 
that I've envisioned</i>

19:32.600 --> 19:34.860
<i>since the moment I became who I am!</i>

19:36.350 --> 19:38.310
The impossible...

19:38.740 --> 19:43.570
is meant to be made possible!

20:00.590 --> 20:02.280
I-It's over...

20:06.530 --> 20:07.960
Miss Anis?

20:20.270 --> 20:23.230
Well done, visitor.

20:24.000 --> 20:25.990
Do you mean me?

20:25.990 --> 20:28.380
You are victorious.

20:28.380 --> 20:32.270
Do as you please with my corpse.

20:32.270 --> 20:33.630
Um...

20:34.460 --> 20:37.930
I'm sorry. You resent me, don't you?

20:38.520 --> 20:40.140
Resent you?

20:45.680 --> 20:47.560
How truly amusing!

20:47.560 --> 20:50.550
In that case, engrave this 
upon your very soul!

20:50.550 --> 20:53.560
My existence, the symbol of my being...

20:53.560 --> 20:57.010
Carry their weight upon your 
shoulders for all eternity!

20:59.630 --> 21:01.730
<i>What... is this?</i>

21:01.730 --> 21:04.540
<i>It's like words... or wisdom...</i>

21:09.380 --> 21:11.370
<i>It's been carved into me!</i>

21:11.660 --> 21:16.100
Ah, you who succeeded in slaying me...

21:16.470 --> 21:19.320
May you... May you forever...

21:19.890 --> 21:23.050
bear this curse.

21:47.460 --> 21:49.650
Victory parties are such a drag.

21:50.230 --> 21:52.840
I just can't handle this kind of atmosphere.

21:52.840 --> 21:54.030
Miss Anis?

21:55.740 --> 21:57.990
Oh, Euphie.

21:57.990 --> 22:00.230
I noticed you were nowhere to be found.

22:00.230 --> 22:02.980
So this is where you ran away to.

22:02.980 --> 22:05.500
What about you? Why are you out here?

22:06.840 --> 22:09.460
As a noble, I may be an accomplished dancer,

22:09.840 --> 22:13.960
but in truth, I find contact with men 
to be a bit oppressive.

22:19.650 --> 22:21.230
Dance with me, Euphie.

22:23.580 --> 22:25.710
It's not as if you hate dancing, right?

22:26.030 --> 22:27.980
So it's a waste not to.

22:28.760 --> 22:31.270
A waste, is it?

22:46.760 --> 22:50.620
If you hadn't taken me away that day,

22:51.040 --> 22:54.760
I might have cried and cried 
until my spirit was broken.

22:55.590 --> 22:57.960
But you took me away from there.

22:58.710 --> 23:00.750
I was so happy.

23:00.750 --> 23:04.120
You gave me a new opportunity 
after I'd failed at everything.

23:04.120 --> 23:05.950
Thank you so much for that.

23:08.930 --> 23:14.870
I'm sure you'll do more reckless things in 
the future, just like slaying that dragon.

23:15.370 --> 23:18.570
You are someone precious
that I can't let out of my sight.

23:19.340 --> 23:24.280
I hope you will continue to keep me 
by your side, Miss Anis.

23:27.810 --> 23:31.570
And I hope you'll always 
stay with me, Euphie!

23:31.970 --> 23:34.970
Episode Five







A Magic Medicine and a Magic Sword 
Subjugate a Magic Dragon

23:34.970 --> 23:39.970
Episode Six







Getting to the Truth of the 
Annulment and the Fascination
